WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.040
Sweety’s dream will remain just a dream, Guddu Pandit.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.640
Sweety's my love.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.720
But I am Sweety's love. Got it?

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.080
The whole of Mirzapur knows this, and now you do too.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.600
I'll finish you right here!

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.480
Why are you both getting so worked up?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.040
One, two chacha cha? Bho..

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.760
Chacha, you're really glowing!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.200
Fighting in Rajasthan’s heat wasn’t enough for you?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.560
Come to think of it, you're right.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.280
From my ear to my rear,

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.120
it's all full of sand.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.280
Even my eggs have boiled in this heat.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:37.960
What are you...

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.360
No not those! This one.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.200
Boiled egg.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.680
But enough now, man. I’m tired. I want to go home.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.640
You spoke my heart, Munna bhaiya!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.640
I'm missing home too.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.000
But we're in Mirzapur. What home are you talking about?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.760
You're so... innocent, chacha.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.440
We're talking about Prime Video.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.320
Mirzapur the movie at home

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.960
Small screen, big scene.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.560
Yeah but this time, we're not going back empty handed.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.160
Absolutely not. The gun’s ready.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.920
No, not the gun. This time we’re taking a cut, an extended one.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.720
Oh right, we’re bringing the Bhaukaal for the family crowd,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.560
so don’t call it the extended cut. 

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.880
Call it the Bhaukaal Cut.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.520
Wow wow wow!

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.920
Wow, wow, wow, Champ!

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.440
Well said. Bhaukaali Cut!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.920
I've arrived, with all my flair.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.920
And I, with my Sweety.

